    <decisions>
        <description>This decision is used for record type Case Retention Shred. For reference Gitlab #10363
This is checking the logic for the Tasks and creating a specific task by using Trigger &apos;Taskobject&apos; and Task Detail Records so kept the subject as Special Characters + Unique Name from Task Details Records.
Trigger will automatically update the Task and its details.</description>
        <name>Check_Task_Logic</name>
